## wait.soar -- agent-world: 1 proposal, 2 compares.

## ---- operator proposal ----

## Propose wait.
sp {agent-world*propose*state-no-change*wait
   "Propose wait if there is a state no-change."
   :default
   (state <s> ^attribute state
              ^choices none
             -^operator.name wait)  # Causes it to be retracted and reproposed
-->
   (<s> ^operator <operator> + <)
   (<operator> ^name wait)
}

## ---- evaluate / compare ----

## Preference for prefer other over wait.
## Make sure wait is never selected over another operator
sp {agent-world*compare*prefer*other*over*wait
   :default
   (state <s> ^operator <operator1> +
              ^operator <operator2> +)
   (<operator1> ^name <> wait)
   (<operator2> ^name wait)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <operator1> > <operator2>)
}

## Preference for state-no-change wait indifferent.
sp {agent-world*compare*state-no-change*wait*indifferent
      :default
      (state <s> ^operator <op1> + ^operator { < <op1> <op2> } +)
      (<op1> ^name wait)
      (<op2> ^name wait)
   -->
      (<s> ^operator <op1> = <op2>)}
